{
	"name": "Advocate",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-white.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You are a champion’s champion, providing aid to your defensive charges with your mere presence and able to track your chosen enemies to an almost uncanny degree. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Strength, Constitution, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with a skill from the following list: Athletics, Culture, History, Insight, Intimidation, Medicine, Perception, Persuasion, or Survival.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on checks to find your offensive target(s) if you lose sight of them and can use the Search action as a bonus action when looking for your offensive target(s).</p></li><li><p>If a defensive target is making death saves, you can automatically stabilize them as an action with a touch. Your defensive target(s) also receive a +1 bonus to their AC as long as they are within 5 feet of you. </p></li><li><p>Your exertion pool increases by 1.</p></li><li><p>You gain an additional combat maneuver of a degree you could learn. It does not count against your maneuvers known.</p></li></ul>",
